+Preflight reserves `4 × payload bound + 1 GiB`, in addition to the storage
+owner's minimum free-space floor. The payload bound counts logical source bytes
+plus per-entry slack and the whole Python framework (including excluded modules),
+with 64 MiB for generated app content. The four simultaneous copies are the
+app payload, native metadata ZIP, public ZIP and native extraction. Isolated
+staging links the large resource trees. APFS clone savings are never required.
